  "description": "Do we really need images for training composed image retrieval (CIR) models? Our answer is NO. \n               We propose <strong>LinCIR</strong>, a language-only training method for CIR. \n               LinCIR shows strong performance with efficeint training cost (e.g., training LinCIR with a CLIP ViT-G backbone in 1 hour)."
